      "International flow arts teacher Yara shows how movement flows in any art from your heart to your body, bypassing the mind. She performs hula hooping, doubles trapeze, cradle and partner acro. Yara loves multi-tasking, animals and painting. Preferably with a cocktail…",
  },
  {
    avatar: '/assets/images/@stock/member-4-4.png',
    name: 'Gabriel Stella',
    position: 'Flying Trapeze',
    socials: [
      { link: 'http://twitter.com', icon: 'twitter' },
      { link: 'http://facebook.com', icon: 'facebook' },
